  "fuselage": {
    "cd0Area": 0.771,
    "cd0AreaSource": "Tuned 2026-11-09 from 1.25 to the owner's own cruise: he sets 2200 rpm on floats and sees about 75 mph indicated. The blade is already fitted (2150 static -> 15.33 deg), so the thrust at 2200 rpm and 75 mph is decided at 848 N; this is the drag that equals it. Cruise is then 49.4 hp, 68 percent of what the C-85 can make at 2200 rpm, against 93 percent before. NOTE: this is LESS than the wheeled Cub's 0.92, and floats cannot be cleaner than a Cub's gear \u2014 so the wheeled aeroplane is too draggy too and wants the same treatment, which needs its own datum and a re-rig.",
